message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "pii-detector-ca: Checksum-validated recognizers and a synthetic benchmark for Canadian clinical de-identification"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Murugaiah
    given-names: Karthikeyan
    # TODO: orcid before minting the Zenodo DOI.
