    alias: thisiskarthikeyan
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-27
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/thisiskarthikeyan/pii-detector-ca"
url: "https://github.com/thisiskarthikeyan/pii-detector-ca"
abstract: >-
  Checksum-validated detectors for Canadian health and government identifiers
  (SIN, Ontario OHIP, Quebec RAMQ, BC PHN, Alberta ULI, postal codes, street
  addresses), usable standalone or as Microsoft Presidio recognizers, with a
  reproducible synthetic clinical-text benchmark, adversarial and
  false-positive splits, and an evaluation harness.
keywords:
  - de-identification
  - PII
  - PHI
  - clinical NLP
  - Presidio
  - Canada
